 uporabnim predmetima ne bi li prodali čim više svojih proizvoda. <br><br>Tako smo dobili kalkulator budilicu, kalkulator upaljač, kalkulator sintesajzer, kalkulator radio, gumeni kalkulator koji se mogao saviti kao papir i spremiti u džep, kalkulator koji izgleda kao tabla čokolade i miriše kao čokolada...</div><div class="qr-and-instructions"><div class="qr-container"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da230b62786b295daa9ab5_image.png" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="desktop" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper"><div class="image-group"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64de256f311aecf346f2721b_Svicarski digitron 2.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 47vw" alt="Abak - antički kalkulator" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/64de256f311aecf346f2721b_Svicarski digitron 2.png 700w" class="heroheader05_image hero-image-size"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background image-background-opacity"><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64db374e19c92a97dd217809_AR ikona - s.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64da230b62786b295daa9ab5_image.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"><img src="/assets/images/final/64de263b9862cb79fde60a4d_10 molekularni abak.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de263b9862cb79fde60a4d_10 molekularni abak.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 25vw" class="featured-image image-size image-size-small"></div></div><div id="w-node-_742371f4-ac15-ef14-2020-df8280acf429-9cb9238d" class="layout58_content" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Najluđi kalkulator<br></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"><img src="/assets/images/final/64de263b9862cb79fde60a4d_10 molekularni abak.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de263b9862cb79fde60a4d_10 molekularni abak.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 65vw, (max-width: 767px) 48vw, (max-width: 991px) 420px, 100vw" class="featured-image image-size image-size-small image-size-position"></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Sumanute eksperimente s kalkulatorima do krajnjih je granica dotjerao škotski znanstvenik James Gimzewski koji je 1997. u IBM-ovom laboratoriju proizveo najmanji kalkulator na svijetu, promjera manjeg od jednog milijuntog dijela milimetra.<br><br>Radilo se o abaku kojem su kuglice bile molekule ugljika 60. Naravno, Gimzewski je želio pokazati da je u stanju pomicati izrazito male objekte, a ne uvesti mikroskope u proces računanja.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-_742371f4-ac15-ef14-2020-df8280acf442-9cb9238d" class="layout58_content" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">VL Tone<br></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"><img src="/assets/images/final/650063d681f2bb8a9a742811_VL Tone.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/650063d681f2bb8a9a742811_VL Tone.png 700w" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 100vw" class="featured-image"></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Kada se VL Tone pojavio na tržištu 1980. predstavljen je kao kalkulator sa sintesajzerom, no ubrzo je postalo jasno kako je sintesajzer važnija komponenta ovog neobičnog uređaja. <br><br>Naime, sposobnost programiranja vlastitog zvuka (ADSR) uz pomoć osam promjenjivih varijabli stvorilo je neslućene mogućnosti za brojne glazbenike širom svijeta. <br></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"><img src="/assets/images/final/650063d681f2bb8a9a742811_VL Tone.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/650063d681f2bb8a9a742811_VL Tone.png 700w" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 33vw" class="featured-image"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"><img src="/assets/images/final/6500663ad101e433e26f549f_8-bitni zvuk.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/6500663ad101e433e26f549f_8-bitni zvuk.png 512w" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"></div></div><div id="w-node-edbe346e-8cf7-7815-aa4b-0662d4398fda-9cb9238d" class="layout58_content" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"><img src="/assets/images/final/6500663ad101e433e26f549f_8-bitni zvuk.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/6500663ad101e433e26f549f_8-bitni zvuk.png 512w" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 100vw" class="featured-image"></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Od svjetskog hita Da, Da, Da njemačke grupe Trio, preko domaćeg terena i pjesme Kokolo grupe Magazin, pa sve do glazbene podloge Volume Alpha video igre Minecraft, 8-bitni zvuk ovog uređaja definirao je čitavu glazbenu eru.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>